  "description": "Farro is combined with fresh ingredients: juicy tomatoes, cucumbers, and herbs. The salad is then flavored with red wine vinaigrette, pine nuts, and crumbled blue cheese.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: white onion → yellow onion; fresh lemon thyme → regular thyme\n\nNotes: Be careful not to overcook the farro. You want it to stand up to the vinaigrette, so remove it from the heat just when it loses its bite.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: You can cook the farro ahead of time and refrigerate it. However, it's best to dress the salad shortly before serving it, ideally at room temperature.",
